# Line endings: LF in the repo and in every checkout, so a shebang line never gets a CR (a CRLF "#!" line is a
# SyntaxError in node) and the CI and Windows agree on bytes. Git leaves files that are stored with CRLF alone
# (upstream game data: converter output is CRLF too, the publisher compares line-ending-insensitively).
* text=auto eol=lf
